put into Legendary weapons and introduce system that drastically favor key resources being abundant in the shop while being near impossible to get through gameplay. The resource needed to acquire the weapon modification items is extremely hard to get, has disrespectful weekly caps, and require you to pay for increased drop rates of Transcendent weapons. The 3 and 5 respective weekly caps on these modification items means you get one or two rerolls per weapon before having to wait another week for one or two more attempts. Ancestor modules were gambling not gameplay that has worsened the game drastically, \n\nTranscendent weapons accelerate the decay of being able to build powerful Descendants without swiping your credit card. Even changes to these systems done rapidly do not put the game on a path that is fun, at this point the studio has gone full gambling over gameplay with the sole intention of milking the few players left. If we wanted to play slot machines for a pay out we would just go to a Casino, because those slot machines have payouts that are actually worth something.\n\nTLDR: Game was borderline pay to progress before, now pay for power is what Season 4 is trying to normalize and it only gets worse from here. Do not waste your time or money on this game as it clearly no longer has a future.", "timestamp_created": 1787495154, "timestamp_updated": 1787495154, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 545, "votes_funny": 20, "weighted_vote_score": "0.875806212425231934", "comment_count": 28, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 29, "count": 56}, {"reaction_type": 31, "count": 15}, {"reaction_type": 28, "count": 13}, {"reaction_type": 26, "count": 4}, {"reaction_type": 24, "count": 3}, {"reaction_type": 32, "count": 3}, {"reaction_type": 34, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "233506635", "author": {"s